    <!--
        The launcher icon's background layer. White rather than a brand colour:
        the figure is a plain black silhouette, and a coloured disc behind it
        would be a second design decision doing no work.

        Deliberately not in values-night. Launcher icons are not re-themed for
        dark mode - the launcher applies its own mask and background treatment -
        so a dark variant here would only ever confuse someone later.
    -->
